<div class="inline-flex p-6 mt-6 mb-6 border xl:p-8 md:mt-12 border-aqua60 text-teal">
<div class="pl-6">
<div class="pt-6 wysiwyg"><span style="font-weight: 400">Mark Ellzey is a Principal Security Researcher with Censys ARC. Before his current role, Mark has worked as both a network security engineer and software developer for several internet service providers and financial institutions for over 22 years.</span></div>
